    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eibelekenya Yosef inkidetidetat oo lmapuusuni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore etulusoyie enkata, neyooki olaitasheikinoni le naisho oo sabibu lo laiguanani le Misiri tenebo olapejoni loo mukateni o laiguanani, aaitagor olkitok lenye ilo aiguanani le Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Negoro Farao te nkaraki lelo aitasheikinok lenyena pokira, olaitasheikimoni kitok le naisho oo sabibu tenebo olapejoni kitok loo mukateni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepik ninche enkaji narripieki iltung'ana arruok natii enkaji olkitok le rripore, teina korokoroni naikenorieki Yosef. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo kitok le rripore neitanap Yosef meing'ura, neisaiai ninche. Netoni inkolong'i naaikash teina aji oo larruok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkewarie nabo, eidetideta pokira, olaitasheikinoni kitok le naisho oo sabibu tenebo olapejoni loo mukateni lo lkitok le Misiri, eikenoro te Korokoroni. Meeta ake oleitu eidetidet enkidetidet enye, nemeeta ake enkidetidet nemeeta enautu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie eyooki Yosef ninche enasirie, nedol ninche, nenyorriki ajo kenyamal oleng pokira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eikilikuana ilaitasheikinok le Farao ootii tenebo te nkaji naenishoreki te enkaji olkitok lenye ajoki, “Ainyoo doi anaaijo kesoto taata intae inkomomi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninche ninye, “Kindetideta duo, nemeeta hoo oltung'ani oidim aibelekenyaki iyiook atoliki aibalakinye.” Nejoki Yosef ninche, “Amaa doi enkibelekenyata aime ene Nkai? Entolikioki atasayia intae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo aitasheikinoni kitok le naisho oo sabibu, neliki Yosef enkidetidet enye nejoki ninye, “Ore te nkidetidet ai etii duoo o sabibu dukuya nanu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore te nchumata eilo sabibu, etii ilng'osil okuni; ore ake peyie eitapuku, nelioyu esidano enye, neku enkimarrati aaku osabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii duoo enkikompe e Farao enkaina ai, naitayu ilng'anayio loo sabibu, naironyaki enkare enye ina kikompe, napik ina kikompe e Farao inkaik e Farao.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie ejoki Yosef ninye, “Ena enkibelekenyata ena kidetidet: ore ilng'osil okuni naa inkolong'i uni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore too nkolong'i uni naa aikidumu Farao endukuya ino nikinyaaki esiaai ino, neaku aipikaki Farao enkaina enye enkikompe enye anaa apake te dukuya aa olaitasheikinoni le naisho oo sabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake tadamuaki tenilo nitum eseriani, nikintaas sii nanu esupatisho peyie kimbalie sii nanu te dukuya Farao, pee kintayu nanu tena aji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kesipa tukul ajo kapurruno te nkop oo Lhebrania; ore sii tene natii maata enataasa peyie aatipikaki atua ewueji e korokoroni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie edol olapejoni loo mukateni ajo ore enkibelekenyata naibelekenya Yosef ajo ekening'unoyu, etiaka sii ninye Yosef “Aidetideta sii nanu, etii nkikapuni uni oo mukateni elukunya ai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore enkikapu natii shumata inkulie netii indaiki oo mpukunot pooki naapejuno e Farao, neinosita imotonyi nena daiki naatii enkikapu natii endukuya ai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newal Yosef ajoki, “Ena enkibelekenyata enye: Ore inkikapuni uni naa inkolong'i uni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore too nkolong'i uni, naa kedumu Farao endukuya ino nikintung'uaa iyie! Nikilili iyie to lchani, ore imotonyi naa keinos inkiri osesen lino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkolong e uni, aa enkolong apa natoinyieki Farao, neitaiki ilaisiaayiak lenyena pooki o sirua nedumu endukuya olaitookoni kitok tenebo endukuya olayierani kitok tiatua ilaisiaayiak lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neshukoki olaitasheikinoni kitok le naisho oo sabibu, nepik enkikompe inkaik e Farao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake eililio ilo apejoni kitok loo mukateni, anaa enatolikio apa Yosef ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake eyia, eitu edamu ilo kitok le naisho oo sabibu Yosef, etorikine ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
